WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:20.825
In the Throne Room, a servant blew a trumpet.

2
00:00:20.826 --> 00:00:27.455
"The king and queen are now entering!"

3
00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:32.652
Everyone bowed.

4
00:00:32.653 --> 00:00:38.217
"Wow," Tom whispered.

5
00:00:38.218 --> 00:00:45.010
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

6
00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:49.305
The queen was holding a book.

7
00:00:49.306 --> 00:00:52.106
Suddenly she frowned.

8
00:00:52.107 --> 00:01:06.274
"Oh, no! I lost my royal bookmark."

9
00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:13.716
"Line up, wizards!" Dirk snapped.

10
00:01:13.717 --> 00:01:17.417
He bowed before the king and queen again.

11
00:01:17.418 --> 00:01:21.898
"The wizards will now do their best spells."

12
00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:25.859
"Yikes." Tom gulped.

13
00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:40.359
"I hope I'm ready, Cat," he whispered.

14
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:44.741
Dirk led a girl to the king and queen.

15
00:01:44.742 --> 00:01:50.546
"This is my daughter, Ann," Dirk said proudly.

16
00:01:50.547 --> 00:01:56.378
Ann bowed and then waved her wand. Poof!

17
00:01:56.379 --> 00:02:00.909
Dozens of beautiful white birds appeared.

18
00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:04.056
The king and queen clapped.

19
00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:31.737
Then all the other wizards did their spells.

20
00:02:31.738 --> 00:02:38.440
At last it was Tom's turn.

21
00:02:38.441 --> 00:02:42.813
"Your Majesties." Tom bowed.

22
00:02:42.814 --> 00:02:44.508
"I'm pleased to meet—"

23
00:02:44.509 --> 00:02:50.598
"Ah-choo!" The queen suddenly sneezed loudly.

24
00:02:50.599 --> 00:02:54.634
"AH-CHOO!" The queen sneezed again.

25
00:02:54.635 --> 00:02:57.321
The king frowned.

26
00:02:57.322 --> 00:02:59.487
"My dear," he said.

27
00:02:59.488 --> 00:03:02.432
"Are you okay?"

28
00:03:02.433 --> 00:03:04.699
"Please," Tom said.

29
00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.191
"Take my handkerchief."

30
00:03:07.192 --> 00:03:09.661
He reached into his pocket.

31
00:03:09.662 --> 00:03:12.502
But Tom did not pull out his handkerchief.

32
00:03:12.503 --> 00:03:14.502
He pulled out . . .

33
00:03:14.503 --> 00:03:19.292
"A cat!" The queen shrieked. "Ah-choo!"

34
00:03:19.293 --> 00:03:23.645
"A cat?" The king leaped to his feet.

35
00:03:23.646 --> 00:03:30.793
"No cats in the palace!"
